    <string name="arc_home_about">ℹ️ What the archiver can do</string>
    <string name="arc_found_title">Archives (%1$d)</string>
    <string name="arc_about">• Create ZIP from files and folders: 4 compression levels, password, delete originals.\n• Browse an archive like a folder: sizes, compression, dates, subfolders.\n• Extract all or selected: here, to a folder named after the archive or to any path; asks before replacing files.\n• Add, delete and rename files inside ZIP.\n• Integrity test (CRC) and archive info.\n• Reads ZIP, JAR, APK, CBZ, TAR, TAR.GZ (TGZ), GZ. RAR and 7z are not supported.\n• Protection against “../” paths and zip bombs.\n\nSelect files and tap “To ZIP” or “More → Add to archive”. Tap an archive to open it.</string>

